        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-country-of-origin-act-2017-sch-1-sec-2-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eaefadb366fda0667c024317e7e9b6400e8b1f3caef0b626c55b14182f6133e9",
      "skos:note": "May prescribe processes or combinations of processes for particular classes of goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-country-of-origin-act-2017#sch-1-sec-2-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(3) Subsections 255(1) to (4) of Schedule 2",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the regulations:\n\n(a) may prescribe (in relation to particular classes of goods or\notherwise) processes or combinations of processes that, for\nthe purposes of that subsection, do not have the result\ndescribed in subsection (2)(b); and\n\n(b) may include examples (in relation to particular classes of\ngoods or otherwise) of processes or combinations of\nprocesses that, for the purposes of that subsection, have the\nresult described in subsection (2)(b)."
    },
